SQL Server showplan XML with a Bitmap operator (parallel bitmap filtering),
which remains genuinely unmodeled after adding Update/Assert support -
per alloy#6941's cross-referenced Showplan operator list, Bitmap, Segment,
and Sequence Project are all still left as Unknown deliberately.

The nested Table Scan is unreachable (no childrenOf call in the default
branch), so it must not appear in the parsed output.

-- unmodeled_operator.xml --
<ShowPlanXML xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/sqlserver/2004/07/showplan">
  <BatchSequence>
    <Batch>
      <Statements>
        <StmtSimple>
          <QueryPlan>
            <RelOp PhysicalOp="Bitmap" LogicalOp="Bitmap Create" EstimateRows="50" EstimatedTotalSubtreeCost="0.03">
              <Bitmap>
                <RelOp PhysicalOp="Table Scan" LogicalOp="Table Scan" EstimateRows="2000" EstimatedTotalSubtreeCost="0.1">
                  <TableScan>
                    <Object Database="[MyDb]" Schema="[dbo]" Table="[Orders]" />
                  </TableScan>
                </RelOp>
              </Bitmap>
            </RelOp>
          </QueryPlan>
        </StmtSimple>
      </Statements>
    </Batch>
  </BatchSequence>
</ShowPlanXML>
